28
00:03:55.285 --> 00:03:56.875
- You're serious?
- Mm-hm.

29
00:03:56.955 --> 00:03:59.107
You let him out,
I'll kill him myself, lock him up.

30
00:03:59.187 --> 00:04:01.246
This is his third offense, Mark.

31
00:04:01.526 --> 00:04:04.927
