168
00:16:20.868 --> 00:16:22.488
- Yeah.
- It's safe?

169
00:16:22.568 --> 00:16:25.055
I don't know, but I think it's worth a shot.

170
00:16:25.135 --> 00:16:29.493
All right. We make our way
